  gpg --verify mes-0.28.tar.gz.sig

The signature should match the fingerprint of the following key:

  pub   rsa4096 2024-11-09 [SC]
        5DBE 23D3 9053 6526 7F8C  C76A FDB9 52BD 3F73 56D6
